@FluxAI.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169
@ApiBase = {{FluxAI.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1
@ScenarioId = fluxia-stage6-c2-8-signals
@SignalControllerId = 457026848
@RunId = 746ac962-28c9-43d2-ba46-79240b2cf044
@OperatorToken = replace-with-operator-token
@WorkerToken = replace-with-worker-token

### Health check
GET {{FluxAI.Api_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### T01 — List scenarios
GET {{ApiBase}}/scenarios?pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### T01 — List C2 signal controllers
GET {{ApiBase}}/signal-controllers?scenarioId={{ScenarioId}}&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Read the seeded demo configuration
GET {{ApiBase}}/configurations/d90f8532-b77e-4b9d-9d4d-0b5851b6a0c2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

### List imported runs
GET {{ApiBase}}/runs?scenarioId={{ScenarioId}}&status=succeeded&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

### Read the known imported replay
GET {{ApiBase}}/runs/{{RunId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

### T10 — Read a page of queue metrics
GET {{ApiBase}}/runs/{{RunId}}/metrics?metricName=queue.vehicles&scope=signalController&signalControllerId={{SignalControllerId}}&pageSize=3
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}

### T10 — Read aggregate signal results
GET {{ApiBase}}/runs/{{RunId}}/signal-results?pageSize=100
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
